<title>USA: U.S. Jan 1 cattle/calf inventory - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Jan 1 cattle/calf inventory - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA U.S. cattle inventory.</p>
<p>    1,000 head:		  Pct-X   1/1/97   1/1/96   1/1/95</p>
<p> Total cattle/calves		98  101,209  103,487  102,755</p>
<p> Cows/heifers that have calved  98   43,561   44,644   44,643</p>
<p> - Beef cows			  97   34,280   35,228   35,156</p>
<p> - Milk cows			  99    9,281    9,416    9,487</p>
<p> Heifers, 500 lbs and over     100   20,306   20,232   19,891</p>
<p> - For beef cow replacement     98    6,051    6,179    6,475</p>
<p> - For milk cow replacement     98    4,037    4,104    4,141</p>
<p> - Other heifers		   103   10,219    9,949    9,275</p>
<p>X-1997 as percent of 1996. Note--1996 data revised.  </p>
<p>    1,000 head:		   Pct-X   1/1/97   1/1/96   1/1/95</p>
<p> Steers, 500 lbs and over	  98   17,315   17,732   17,463</p>
<p> Bulls, 500 lbs and over	   98    2,339    2,392    2,390</p>
<p> Calves, under 500 lbs	     96   17,688   18,488   18,369</p>
<p>    1,000 head:		   Pct-Y   1/1/96   1/1/95   1/1/94</p>
<p> Calf crop			     98   39,586   40,211   40,059</p>
<p>Y-1996 as percent of 1995. Note--1996 data revised.  </p>
<p>U.S. cattle and calf balance sheet:</p>
<p>    Million head:		  1996     1995     1994</p>
<p> Jan 1 inventory, year start  103.5    102.8    101.0</p>
<p> Calf crop and imports	   41.6     43.0     42.1</p>
<p> Total supply-Z		   145.0    145.8    143.1</p>
<p> Slaughter			   38.6     37.3     35.7</p>
<p> Death and exports		  4.7	4.5	4.5</p>
<p> Total disappearance-Z	   43.3     41.8     40.2</p>
<p> Residual-Z			  -0.5     -0.5     -0.2</p>
<p> Jan 1 year-end inventory     101.2    103.5    102.8</p>
<p>Z-May not add due to rounding.</p>
</text>
